    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Even though gather oil Gu is rank five, it does not expend primeval essence but the Gu Master’s bone marrow, so even rank one Gu Masters can use it. Overuse without restraint can kill the user. Used with bone path Gu worms, it is described as very safe.",
